{"data":{"body":"**[P2] Remove the unenforced instance-level exclusivity contract.** Validation reads only `DurableExecutionPluginFactory.getExclusiveGroup()` before instances exist. A factory can therefore return a plugin overriding this method while leaving its own group null, allowing multiple supposedly exclusive plugins to run. Keep this metadata solely on the factory, or redesign registration to enforce instance metadata and add coverage.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc74pJzG","finding_digest":"c0248bacd0200e3c1f01137cbc9ebf2c6e2f158d43ad324c0140ce920fb1a912","finding_id":"arf_v1_yasixlgqeahdyhybcn6lzhv7fr","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/durableexecutionplugin::getexclusivegroup::factory-only-validation","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/durableexecutionplugin::getexclusivegroup::factory-only-validation","line":26,"observation_digest":"46d378bb1b1b640c0bd51569cde20af1c479978f6d24d6cc96a318b6545f7c90","observation_id":"aro_v1_i3jxroy3dnsayc6vcvu43yqk6h","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/DurableExecutionPlugin.java","prior_finding_id":"","published_at":"2026-10-03T03:34:46Z","review_id":"arr_v1_z6oi3g5fbnek4iawnt2wtkqxrf","reviewed_base_sha":"61f5d103651c2bafc54f840a539cf55a95f47df7","reviewed_head_sha":"c6a16af9c6bd5950227e871adcfc3ded02a96939","reviewer":"codex","start_line":18,"suggestion_id":"arsg_v1_j4f7k7qihk3je4bikbbzvhuva2"},"pull_request":{"number":721},"record_id":"art_v1_c3hkdhpcpv4qfiw7c2durw4so6","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-03T03:34:46Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
